Day 30 – Surrounded Regions
Problem Solved
Surrounded Regions (LeetCode 130)
Concepts Used
BFS
Grid Traversal
Boundary Traversal
Connected Components
Graph Representation of Matrix
Approach
Traverse all boundary cells.
Start BFS from every boundary 'O'.
Mark all reachable 'O' cells as safe.
Traverse the grid again.
Convert every unvisited 'O' to 'X'.
Key Insight

Instead of finding surrounded regions directly:

Find boundary-connected regions.
Mark them as safe.
Capture everything else.
Complexity
Time: O(m × n)
Space: O(m × n)
